Rates are computed per fresh repetition over measured batches. Construction, warmup, controls and client close are reported separately. Parent probes may affect timing; their overhead is not claimed to be zero. Warmup and all individual stream/frame observations remain in JSON. CV requires at least three fresh repetitions; the predeclared flag is 10%.

